                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Note:</hi> Figures compiled by MAAG based on ARVN reports show 96
                    civilians killed and 37 civilians kidnapped during January and 122 civilians
                    killed, 72 kidnapped in February, 1960. Figures for these months for
                    assassinations and kidnappings may be slightly higher (but will not greatly
                    differ from these figures) after finalization based on other sources.</p>
